# Implementation Plan: Real AI Analytics System

## Goal

Replace the current rule-based analytics system with a real AI system using genuine Machine Learning algorithms (implemented in pure PHP — no external ML libraries or APIs needed). The system covers 5 modules as requested.

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[AI Engine Core] --> B[LinearRegression]
    A --> C[ExponentialSmoothing]
    A --> D[KMeansClustering]
    A --> E[CosineSimilarity]
    A --> F[AnomalyDetector]
    
    B --> G[Sales Forecasting]
    C --> G
    D --> H[Customer Behavior Analysis]
    E --> I[Product Recommendations]
    F --> J[Pattern Detection]
    
    G --> K[AnalyticsService]
    H --> K
    J --> K
    
    I --> L[RecommendationService]
    
    K --> M[Smart Alerts]
    K --> N[Sales Predictions]
```

## Proposed Changes

### AI Engine Core (5 new files)

These are standalone math/ML classes — pure algorithms with no Laravel dependencies.

---

#### [NEW] [LinearRegression.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Services/AI/LinearRegression.php)

Implements Ordinary Least Squares (OLS) regression for trend analysis and forecasting:
- `train(array $x, array $y)` — calculates slope (β₁, β₀) using the OLS formula
- [predict(float $x)](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Models/ProductAnalytics.php#125-135) — returns predicted Y for a given X
- `rSquared()` — returns the R² coefficient of determination (model accuracy)
- Used by: Sales predictions, product trend analysis

#### [NEW] [ExponentialSmoothing.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Services/AI/ExponentialSmoothing.php)

Implements Double Exponential Smoothing (Holt's method) for time-series forecasting:
- `train(array $data, float $alpha, float $beta)` — learns level and trend components
- `forecast(int $periods)` — predicts next N periods
- `autoOptimize(array $data)` — tests different α/β values and selects the best (grid search)
- Used by: Sales predictions (replaces simple average)

#### [NEW] [KMeansClustering.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Services/AI/KMeansClustering.php)

Implements K-Means clustering algorithm for customer segmentation:
- `cluster(array $data, int $k, int $maxIterations)` — groups data points into K clusters
- `assignCluster(array $point)` — assigns a new point to the nearest cluster
- `silhouetteScore()` — evaluates clustering quality
- Used by: Customer segmentation (replaces hardcoded thresholds)

#### [NEW] [CosineSimilarity.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Services/AI/CosineSimilarity.php)

Implements cosine similarity for collaborative filtering recommendations:
- `similarity(array $vectorA, array $vectorB)` — calculates cosine similarity
- `buildUserItemMatrix(array $orders)` — creates user-item interaction matrix
- `findSimilarUsers(int $userId, array $matrix, int $topN)` — finds similar users
- `findSimilarItems(int $itemId, array $matrix, int $topN)` — finds similar items
- Used by: Product recommendations (collaborative filtering)

#### [NEW] [AnomalyDetector.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Services/AI/AnomalyDetector.php)

Implements statistical anomaly detection using Z-Score and IQR:
- `detectZScore(array $data, float $threshold)` — identifies outliers via Z-score
- `detectIQR(array $data, float $multiplier)` — identifies outliers via Interquartile Range
- `trendAnomaly(array $timeSeries)` — detects abnormal trend shifts
- Used by: Pattern detection, smart alerts

---

### Service Layer (2 major rewrites)

---

#### [MODIFY] [AnalyticsService.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php)

Major rewrite — all methods replaced with AI-powered versions:

| Method | Before | After |
|--------|--------|-------|
| [generateSalesPredictions()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php#36-81) | Simple average × growth | **Exponential Smoothing** + **Linear Regression** with auto-optimization |
| [calculateConfidenceScore()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php#96-107) | Hardcoded tiers by days | Dynamic score based on R² + data variance + data volume |
| [detectPatterns()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Http/Controllers/AnalyticsController.php#123-132) | Threshold-based rules | **Z-Score anomaly detection** on sales, revenue, and orders |
| [detectLowStock()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php#125-151) | Static threshold `< 10` | **Regression-predicted** stock depletion: "will run out in X days" |
| [detectSalesDrop()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php#152-177) | `sales_trend < -30` | Statistical anomaly detection with Z-score |
| [detectAtRiskCustomers()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php#178-204) | `days > 30` | K-Means cluster-based churn probability |
| [updateAllCustomerAnalytics()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php#15-24) | N+1 queries | Chunked + eager loading |
| [updateAllProductAnalytics()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/AnalyticsService.php#25-35) | `Article::all()` | `Article::chunk(100, ...)` |

#### [MODIFY] [RecommendationService.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/RecommendationService.php)

Major rewrite — all recommendation methods replaced:

| Method | Before | After |
|--------|--------|-------|
| [getFrequentlyBoughtTogether()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/RecommendationService.php#14-26) | Pre-computed array lookup | **Item-Item Collaborative Filtering** with cosine similarity |
| [getPersonalizedRecommendations()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Http/Controllers/AnalyticsController.php#187-204) | Filter by category/brand | **User-User Collaborative Filtering** + content-based hybrid with **weighted scoring** |
| [getSimilarProducts()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/services/RecommendationService.php#74-87) | Random from same category | **Content-based similarity** using category + brand + price range + ratings |
| [getTrendingProducts()](file:///c:/laragon/www/fin-etude-back/app/Http/Controllers/AnalyticsController.php#285-290) | Query by `performance_category` | **Momentum scoring** with weighted recency and velocity |

